  speakerName: "Ph\xF3 l\xE0ng"
  title: "Giao di\u1EC7n ch\xEDnh"
  content: "\"Nh\xECn l\xEAn g\xF3c m\xE0n h\xECnh \u2014 \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 thanh
    t\xE0i nguy\xEAn c\u1EE7a l\xE0ng. Ngay d\u01B0\u1EDBi l\xE0 menu x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng.
    M\u1ECDi quy\u1EBFt \u0111\u1ECBnh c\u1EE7a c\u1EADu \u0111\u1EC1u b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u
    t\u1EEB hai n\u01A1i n\xE0y.\""
